      "description": "Catalogo, Collane, In evidenza, Ebook under the header; mist inactive, navy active with aria-current.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Sezioni dei libri\"><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Catalogo</a><a href=\"#\">Collane</a><a href=\"#\">In evidenza</a><a href=\"#\">Ebook</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}.ds-tabs a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 24px;background:#f2f4f6;color:#343434;font:600 1rem/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .15s,color .15s}.ds-tabs a:hover{background:rgba(0,72,129,.1);color:#004881}.ds-tabs a[aria-current=page]{background:#004881;color:#fff}.ds-tabs a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus-ring,#004881);outline-offset:2px}"
