      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-card-field\"><div class=\"ds-card-cover\"></div></div><div class=\"ds-card-body\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Combattenti per la pace</h3><p class=\"ds-card-by\">Daniela Bezzi</p><p class=\"ds-card-meta\">Semi di pace · 2024 · Ebook</p><p class=\"ds-card-price\">12,00 €</p></div></a>",
